    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f591d972db5f26ed95884cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯？　……啊，对哦！这个作战，\n如果抢不到沿内侧护栏的位置就不通用了呢。废弃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a116de2f8438a82fc969338fcf31d67c763c5532343e15ecb2116638ebc0ea6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b51a4b3fdae66dba1ba40498",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（但是如果想让方案变得更有趣的话……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "910833ffec82356277a2f0185ccf6d72a306f83a91477b58446880c0e6628832",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af6ed75f1592fb65bcdbecc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于过于短视的回答喊了停。她总是接二连三地产生新\n想法，所以对于舍弃想法或许也没什么犹豫吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6677d3e12a2e0d19196b189a28d92f5e6c981a4cd0f5322c0d08978876323eac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86aae4c9379c62c748d861eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊，因为想认真面对你的点子",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aa951853b4a4656bb59aaf4f4c975309447891038f5cbea0db4578da557d9c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2934e90dfe26a020f4ec737",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，因为想认真面对你的点子",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0163980655bf2c5d54bb80b1f729c93f7a46ac72ccc2936c8d16247f3458a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
