    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65115aacc3d39c9d6baf8827",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……？　今天的训练员，\n总觉得说话吞吞吐吐的。一直抱着胳膊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e577d9a8ba905389811e6a1877766d50b92de7abf25773f84e31e31e95308391",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b3f2a759ad66b1ae479135",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有一件在意的事。如果像上次一样末脚决胜的话，\n普通来说目光应该放在直线的最高速度，而不是过弯上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6f542d3f822e0a126ab16c100ac6897a57f82ff890788d95921a32d52b41878",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:415cb7c53e1343cd4fe0ccbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个点子，试着扩展成别的方案看看",
      "source_fingerprint": "2edcefbc67ea23beb1ec38d41e053614806a630ac2347489addb1fdbf105192d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b8f5df463af5e4ad1523554",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她没有那么做。那里应该是有某种意图的。\n如果没有自觉的话……就促使她语言化，将无意识转化为有形之物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de96d872c5f6423c819e9b1053df22a9d85a4208901b8d85b7f29dd74fc78b4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35218a44a0968a410e65c5f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果是你应该能找到更有趣的方案",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e0c126c01b97b56d3410ca596d271d0a5b7b7eec9c1e2213bff75596a79e67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
