    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bebc269a3e9355bf3966dbb8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我希望比赛中的赛马娘能随心所欲地奔跑。\n所以我不会指示该怎么做。思考的是你哦，神业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2deedddab723dda6c22017b9ada1b489d5817716c74e5868661fdbab919c8bee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
