    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b55314acade793c42599401",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那天夜里，神业发来了长达48页的漫画分镜稿。\n看来她是用漫画构思了比赛的构想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "921bc57aa8c16eb70d45a9c8da4912f1735fe226d91f4f2c003550c0e7d90b37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9efb4c23eef16f3b1c7ec3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决定全力面对后过了几天。老实说，现在的自己所处的状况，\n……就算随时被她甩下一纸休书也不奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5944677510fed275c84e938b548993c0841473d371a9809fa54a2ab165103d6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c01409e485b62f59ed41b748",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，即便如此……也想做到底",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbfdf079d9ed922111c1d3ac46ae37de4bb08e171ac709d71cc82d99cd7e8fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61bf446fa9949f15cf15388a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业是作家气质的赛马娘。应该想心情舒畅地致力于作品吧。\n这种被迫原地踏步的状况，她应该不会喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe73eb95048d55438721c0e2456a00772ad4d0f47987d732ae21d1fa03f460ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f84d579dbd5a2989cd655aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中坚训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a34931cc602589e873be74227a6e41b3d1912d31684f0db4e6ce1da01bd519",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cb2a6074f044ae45fd2d5a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来，自由地奔跑吧！你的干劲和创造性由我来守护！\n那份自主性才是你珍藏的武器！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7218f80af5ee12757be08d5c14183c76ada87252085762f34373055e3e0ed54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9cfc421064591f2f0640bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为你是，能创造出最棒奔跑的赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "7093ef95a46dd154e355031f5cd39197c3afc4a18721cad550ebc470e6fc2c23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b57474e6f941de267f3539",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为你是，能创造出最棒奔跑的赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "7093ef95a46dd154e355031f5cd39197c3afc4a18721cad550ebc470e6fc2c23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac0d6fd5c6806abd1c9ab3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……希望她能彻底地面对她的创作。\n如果能辅助那个的话我什么都愿意做。哪怕被自己被讨厌了也无所谓――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec93c90e2c2e785b7da0ff5fb3d5d5583b1c8b09a75b954ae811408cdc71277f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04ec31e0d471556187ac586e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（滴答、滴答滴答滴答……哗————！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d7e513f113cc518385163292909200ba338ad22b5192fec4fe29140caf7907",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
