      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:339fd0e24d2229b44a6b4df7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "周末。为了给神业买新资料刚出门，\n就遇到了骤雨，落得进退两难的境地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfea0a51672b5f86829b645368c008d716b8b2efd131e606efd196a371c48bd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb7b60195cbc47c78f620ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（糟了啊……――嗯？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c85a196e80e290112f1aa68d094b69713f65133ee0960537c2af638f1db5311",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3150fd6cf5ab72770e79f24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且雨势越来越大。虽然盘算着等一下也许会停却落空了……\n电车的时刻表似乎也相当混乱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b27751c430304f596c4fa7920cbd6d0365560ab6e812f9c525730a2bf60c3173",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
